WEBVTT
Kind: subtitles
Language: en

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.445
HELIX: Anomaly located. Send all four.

2
00:00:04.783 --> 00:00:08.532
NEXUS: Four huntresses. A single prey.

3
00:00:10.017 --> 00:00:13.586
HELIX: LINCE unit. One shot, one kill.

4
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.141
NEXUS: Her shield first.

5
00:00:25.492 --> 00:00:28.291
NEXUS: Now your body fights for me.

6
00:00:31.067 --> 00:00:34.272
HELIX: AEGIS unit compromised.

7
00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:39.993
HELIX: The signal jumps from body to body. Track it.

8
00:00:40.043 --> 00:00:44.664
HELIX: VELA unit. Keeper of the archive. She erases whatever awakens.

9
00:00:44.842 --> 00:00:48.195
NEXUS: Too late. I’m already awake.

10
00:00:53.225 --> 00:00:55.767
NEXUS: Then let her hear this one.

